          },
          "body": "Do you have a proposed fix for this...?  Or, why is RegexQuery treating the trailing \".\" as a \".*\" instead?",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=mikemccand",
            "name": "mikemccand",
            "key": "mikemccand",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Michael McCandless",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "created": "2009-07-16T17:49:13.417+0000",
          "updated": "2009-07-16T17:49:13.417+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12427605/comment/12732060",
          "id": "12732060",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=sarowe",
            "name": "sarowe",
            "key": "steve_rowe",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=steve_rowe&avatarId=37258",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=steve_rowe&avatarId=37258",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=steve_rowe&avatarId=37258",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=steve_rowe&avatarId=37258"
            },
            "displayName": "Steven Rowe",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "bq. ... why is RegexQuery treating the trailing \".\" as a \".*\" instead? \n\nJavaUtilRegexCapabilities.match() is implemented as j.u.regex.Matcher.lookingAt(), which is equivalent to adding a trailing \".*\", unless you explicity append a \"$\" to the pattern.\n\nBy contrast, JakartaRegexpCapabilities.match() is implemented as RE.match(), which does not imply the trailing \".*\".\n\nThe difference in the two implementations implies this is a kind of bug, especially since the javadoc \"contract\" on RegexCapabilities.match() just says \"@return true if string matches the pattern last passed to compile\".\n\nThe fix is to switch JavaUtilRegexCapabilities.match to use Matcher.match() instead of lookingAt().",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=sarowe",
            "name": "sarowe",
            "key": "steve_rowe",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=steve_rowe&avatarId=37258",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=steve_rowe&avatarId=37258",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=steve_rowe&avatarId=37258",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=steve_rowe&avatarId=37258"
            },
            "displayName": "Steven Rowe",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "created": "2009-07-16T18:11:41.914+0000",
          "updated": "2009-07-16T18:12:47.063+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12427605/comment/12737620",
          "id": "12737620",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=mikemccand",
            "name": "mikemccand",
            "key": "mikemccand",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Michael McCandless",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "I agree this is a bug -- I'll switch to matches shortly.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=mikemccand",
            "name": "mikemccand",
            "key": "mikemccand",
            "avatarUrls": {
